<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Dear&nbsp;</font><font face="arial">{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">,</span></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Thank you for your interest in minoring in music at the Herberger Institute for Design and the Arts School of Music at ASU. As one of the largest universities in the country, the ASU School of Music awards over $2 million to students annually, providing an excellent education at an unbeatable value. ASU's diverse and innovative community is a perfect complement to the personal attention you will receive in the School of Music. With a population of around 750 students, we offer small class sizes, state-of-the-art facilities and one-on-one instruction from world-renowned faculty. We invite you to consider the ASU School of Music for this important step in your music studies.</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b>Music Minors</b></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">We offer two music minors which are also available as BIS concentrations.</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Music Performance Minor</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><ul><li>Includes private instruction in one instrument</li><li>Requires an audition</li></ul></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Music Studies Minor</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><ul><li>Academic and does not include instrumental instruction</li><li>Does not require an audition</li></ul></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b>How to add a Music Performance Minor:</b></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b><br></b></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><font color="#990000"><b>Step 1</b></font>: Contact <a href="mailto:musicadmissions@asu.edu">MusicAdmissions@asu.edu</a> and indicate your major instrument when you are ready to audition. &nbsp;We will give you the contact information of a faculty member who you can contact to set up an audition.</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><b><font color="#990000">Step 2</font></b>: Contact a faculty member to set up an audition. &nbsp;Prepare the non-performance <a href="http://music.asu.edu/admissions/auditions/">audition requirements</a> for undergraduates. If you aren't sure what to prepare, ask the faculty member.</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><b><font color="#990000">Step 3</font></b>: If you pass the audition, the School of Music will send an email saying that you are admitted to the Music Performance minor. Make an appointment with your major area advisor and bring the email with you.</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b>How to Add a Music Studies Minor</b>:</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><b><font color="#990000">Step 1</font></b>: Consult with your major area advisor to add the minor.</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">We welcome you to contact us via email to <a href="mailto:musicadmissions@asu.edu">MusicAdmissions@asu.edu</a> if you have any additional questions. We also encourage you to refer to the School of Music website, <a href="http://music.asu.edu/">music.asu.edu</a>, as a resource for your admissions questions.</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Best Wishes,</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Office of Admissions</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">School of Music</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Herberger Institute for Design and the Arts</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Arizona State University</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>